# Cloudflare Access apps to keep tokens for, one origin per line.
# `cf-access login` refreshes every stale one; the first browser tap warms the org
# session so the rest mint without interaction.
#
# Origins only — cloudflared caches tokens per hostname, so a path would miss the cache.
https://ci.example.com          # CI server
https://dashboard.example.com   # internal dashboard
